        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aníng ngiri hootiís bihhaá tloomar'eé' tidá' hhoohhoó' wa ale, nee nguri tsuúq. Tluwaay nguri huúw ar qom'aá hariimá', nee tluwaaywí a tluwoó tsuuqaá koóm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xaa'aá baraá qamu mamu ngi laqwaaliyá', yaamu mamaá yaariir ngi laqwaaliyá', nee mamuudá' niri hootiyá' ar wayda. Qoomár aníng him'eedá' inooín kira tsegiít bara tsaát, nee in tuú/ baraá dabaá kudá' ngaa lawaale tleehhi'i, aníng daqaní i tsaahhiyá' adór tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín ki baloó slakaatiiká nee xoorór hatlá', laqaá tawa /aymár makaá sla/a. Inooín in hootiyá' ar saxareemo, nee heé gi baloó dae tsaát i kaahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng in qamaá xawuú koomá' i sláw as qwari mingiwa hhaamiís baraá yaamuwo, laqaá mikiwa malé waaqaá' nee xoordaá hatlá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín ngiri tsaahhiyá' adór anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín tar dinkwa nee inooín, nee adór múk Israeli tar muk'eé'. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
